@startuml
!theme plain

title OSINT Service - Cybersecurity Learning Loop

start
:Client brief;
:Govern\nSet scope, budget, and risk tolerance;
:Identify\nMap critical assets and dependencies;
:Plan OSINT collection;
repeat
  :Collect public observations;
  :Corroborate evidence\nCheck freshness, reliability, and independence;
  :Narrow or expand collection if needed;
repeat while (Evidence sufficient?) is (No) not (Yes)
:Map threat goals\nMITRE ATT&CK tactics;

:Prioritize risk\nSeverity + exploitation + exposure + impact;
:Choose defenses\nProtect + Detect + Respond + Recover;

if (Incident occurs?) then (Yes)
  :Contain and communicate;
  :Recover and validate service;
else (No)
  :Deliver recommendations;
endif

:After Action Report\nFacts, uncertainty, residual risk, lessons;
:Improve maturity and next playbook;
stop

@enduml
